            <ArticleTitle>The use of continuous epidural morphine infusions in small children: a report of two cases.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>152-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The use of continuous epidural morphine infusions for postoperative analgesia in small children has not previously been described. The authors present experience with two such cases.</AbstractText>
